  "The view sessions open in. Picking a view from a session’s Transcript view menu changes only that session.": "新打开的会话使用此视图。通过会话内的视图菜单更改时，仅影响当前会话。",
  "Sessions": "会话",
  "Allow bypass permissions mode": "允许跳过权限检查",
  "Lets sessions and scheduled tasks use Bypass permissions, where Claude skips all permission checks. That’s risky: it can lead to data loss, system corruption, or data exfiltration, for example through prompt injection.": "允许会话和定时任务跳过所有权限检查。提示注入等情况可能导致数据丢失、系统损坏或数据外泄。",
  "Dynamic workflows": "动态工作流",
  "Let Claude run multiple agents in parallel for complex tasks. Workflows can use a lot of your usage limit quickly.": "允许 Claude 并行运行多个智能体处理复杂任务。这可能很快消耗大量使用额度。",
  "Draw attention on notifications": "通过任务栏提醒我",
  "Flash the taskbar button when Claude needs your attention and the app isn’t focused.": "Claude 需要你处理事项且应用位于后台时，让任务栏按钮闪烁。",
  "Keep computer awake while Claude works": "Claude 工作时保持电脑唤醒",
  "Prevent your computer from sleeping while a Code session is running, so long tasks can finish. Your display can still turn off. Closing the laptop lid will still put it to sleep.": "编程会话运行时阻止电脑休眠，让长任务顺利完成。显示器仍可关闭，合上笔记本盖仍会休眠。",
  "Keep awake on battery power": "使用电池时也保持唤醒",
  "Prompt suggestions": "提示词建议",
  "Show a suggested next prompt in the message box after Claude replies. Suggestions add a little to your usage.": "Claude 回复后，在输入框显示建议的下一条提示词。建议会消耗少量额度。",
  "Suggestions stay hidden while Claude’s summary and next steps are showing.": "显示摘要和后续步骤时，暂时隐藏提示词建议。",
  "Summary and next steps": "摘要与后续步骤",
  "Show Claude’s short summary and suggested next steps after Claude finishes. Applies to new sessions.": "Claude 完成任务后显示简短摘要和后续步骤建议。适用于新会话。",
  "Archive inactive sessions": "归档不活跃的会话",
  "Automatically archive local sessions after a period of no activity. Sessions that are running or have background work are never archived, and a worktree with uncommitted changes is kept on disk for a while.": "本地会话闲置一段时间后自动归档。运行中或有后台任务的会话始终保留；含未提交更改的工作树会在磁盘上保留一段时间。",
  "Never": "从不",
  "When you ask for an unrelated task": "收到无关任务时",
  "A task that isn’t part of what a session is doing can run in its own linked session. Choose whether Claude asks each time, keeps it in the session you typed it in, or opens a linked session for it.": "与当前会话无关的任务可在独立的关联会话中运行。你可以选择每次询问、留在当前会话或打开关联会话。",
  "Ask me": "询问我",
  "Worktree location": "工作树位置",
  "Where to store Git worktrees for isolated coding sessions on this computer.": "在本机存放独立编程会话所用 Git 工作树的位置。",
  "Inside project": "项目内",
  "Switch models in Claude Code on this computer": "在本机的 Claude Code 中切换模型",
  "When a message is flagged, switch without asking. When off, Claude asks first, or stops if it can’t ask.": "消息被标记时自动切换模型。关闭后，Claude 会先询问；若无法询问，则停止。",
  "Output style": "输出风格",
  "How Claude structures its responses in Code sessions. Applies to new sessions; the session menu can override it for a single session.": "决定 Claude 在编程会话中如何组织回复。适用于新会话，也可在单个会话的菜单中更改。",
  "Default": "默认",
  "Browser tools": "浏览器工具",
  "Claude can start dev servers, open a live preview, and verify code changes with screenshots, snapshots, and DOM inspection.": "Claude 可启动开发服务器、打开实时预览，并通过截图、快照和 DOM 检查验证代码更改。",
  "Auto-open files Claude writes": "自动打开 Claude 写入的文件",
  "HTML, images, PDFs, and videos Claude writes open in the built-in browser.": "使用内置浏览器打开 Claude 写入的 HTML、图片、PDF 和视频。",
  "Keep cookies": "保留 Cookie",
  "Save cookies, local storage, and login sessions for Browser tabs across app restarts. Shared uses the same data for every session in a project. Per session gives each session its own copy, so sessions never see each other’s logins.": "跨应用重启保存浏览器标签页的 Cookie、本地存储和登录状态。「共享」在项目内共用一份数据；「按会话」分别保存，各会话的登录状态互不相通。",
